PropertySanta AI-Powered Cleaning Management System
Testing Guide & Project Status Report

================================================================================
PROJECT OVERVIEW
================================================================================

Project Name: PropertySanta AI-Powered Green Cleaning & Intelligent Task Management
Firebase Project ID: cleaningworkflowapp
Development Status: Phase 1 Complete - Web Applications Ready for Testing

================================================================================
SYSTEM ARCHITECTURE
================================================================================

The system consists of four main components:

1. ADMIN DASHBOARD (Web Application)
   - URL: https://cleaningworkflowapp-admin-site.web.app
   - Purpose: Property management, task assignment, monitoring, and reporting
   - Technology: Next.js, React, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS

2. CUSTOMER PORTAL (Web Application)
   - URL: https://cleaningworkflowapp-customer-site.web.app
   - Purpose: Property owners to view cleaning reports, manage properties, and communicate
   - Technology: Next.js, React, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS

3. CLEANER APPLICATION (Web Application)
   - URL: https://cleaningworkflowapp-cleaner-site.web.app
   - Purpose: Cleaners to receive tasks, upload photos, and complete cleaning workflows
   - Technology: Next.js, React, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS

4. BACKEND API (Node.js Server)
   - Purpose: Handles data processing, AI integration, and business logic
   - Technology: Node.js, Express, MongoDB, Google Gemini AI
   - API Endpoints: Authentication, Tasks, Properties, AI Chat, Reports

