================================================================================
TESTING INSTRUCTIONS
================================================================================

STEP 1: ACCESS THE APPLICATIONS

1. Admin Dashboard Testing:
   - Open: https://cleaningworkflowapp-admin-site.web.app
   - Test user creation and management
   - Create test properties with cleaning requirements
   - Assign tasks to cleaners
   - Monitor cleaning progress

2. Customer Portal Testing:
   - Open: https://cleaningworkflowapp-customer-site.web.app
   - Register as a property owner
   - Add properties with specific requirements
   - View cleaning reports and photos
   - Test communication features

3. Cleaner Application Testing:
   - Open: https://cleaningworkflowapp-cleaner-site.web.app
   - Login with cleaner credentials
   - Receive and view assigned tasks
   - Upload before/after photos
   - Complete cleaning workflows
   - Test AI chat assistance

STEP 2: TESTING SCENARIOS

Scenario 1: Complete Cleaning Workflow
1. Admin creates a new property with cleaning requirements
2. Admin assigns cleaning task to a cleaner
3. Cleaner receives task notification
4. Cleaner uploads before photos
5. Cleaner completes cleaning tasks
6. Cleaner uploads after photos
7. AI analyzes photos and provides scoring
8. Admin reviews completed work
9. Customer receives cleaning report

Scenario 2: AI Chat Integration
1. Cleaner starts chat with AI assistant
2. AI provides cleaning manual and instructions
3. Cleaner asks questions about specific tasks
4. AI responds with contextual guidance
5. Cleaner uploads photos for verification
6. AI analyzes photos and provides feedback

Scenario 3: Issue Reporting
1. Cleaner discovers maintenance issues
2. Cleaner reports issues through the system
3. Admin receives issue notification
4. Admin assigns maintenance tasks
5. Customer is notified of issues
6. Issue resolution tracking

STEP 3: TECHNICAL TESTING

1. Performance Testing:
   - Test application loading times
   - Verify photo upload functionality
   - Check real-time updates via WebSocket
   - Test concurrent user access

2. Security Testing:
   - Verify authentication and authorization
   - Test data encryption
   - Check API endpoint security
   - Validate user role permissions

3. Compatibility Testing:
   - Test on different browsers (Chrome, Firefox, Safari, Edge)
   - Test on mobile devices
   - Verify responsive design
   - Check accessibility features

