================================================================================
KNOWN ISSUES & LIMITATIONS
================================================================================

1. SMS/WhatsApp Integration
   - Status: Not implemented yet
   - Impact: Cleaners currently use web interface instead of text messages
   - Workaround: Use the web-based cleaner application

2. Payment Processing
   - Status: Not implemented yet
   - Impact: No automated payment processing
   - Workaround: Manual payment tracking through admin dashboard

3. Mobile Applications
   - Status: Web applications only
   - Impact: Limited mobile experience
   - Workaround: Use mobile browsers for testing

4. Advanced AI Features
   - Status: Basic AI integration complete
   - Impact: Limited computer vision capabilities
   - Workaround: Manual photo review and scoring

